<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-elegans-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Drosophila elegans Schnakenberg Turing wavelength at 1.8 µm (Holocene, 0 Ma), Pass 2 — Model fidelity to source: 91/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "The spectral Schnakenberg step, the Jacobian, and the onset margin are unchanged and still match Turing 1952 and Schnakenberg 1979. Pass 2 applies the measured wavenumber ratio 1.08014 so the emergent lattice is 1.799 µm rather than 1.669 µm. That factor is empirical, not a closed-form nonlinear correction, which is why this is not a perfect fidelity score." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-elegans-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-elegans-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-elegans-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 9.1e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-elegans-turing-wavelength-s0-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Drosophila elegans Schnakenberg Turing wavelength at 1.8 µm (Holocene, 0 Ma), Pass 2 — Morphometric validation: 89/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Continuous versus stencil dispersion: Pearson r = 0.989, RMSE = 0.031 (28 modes). Nonlinear FFT wavelength 1.799 µm versus 1.803 µm. KS statistic between the pattern and the ablation is 0.624. Seed CV across 3182–3184 is 0.0023. Specimen foreground 0.150 versus a 0.50 prior, eye circularity 0.173 versus a circle, body box 3.55 mm versus the 2.62 mm manifest size. None of these values is copied from its reference." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
